{
  "name": "page-layout-trace",
  "description": "A layout whose draw fails by the armed diagnostic fault records its trace phases queued, prepare, prepared, draw and cancelled as events of the class frame, which the policy stores at the level debug; the events reach the host in batches after the clock anchor, and the failed presentation is recorded as an error.",
  "replay": false,
  "reason": "The performance switch is a call of the host that the Go producer does not run (packages/host/go/tests/page_wire_test.go answers only log and workspace).",
  "writer": {
    "policy": true
  },
